<speak>You can contact me through the bank's usual secure channel if you need help locating correspondence associated with a conversation. When I send a covering message, I can identify its purpose clearly and use a recognisable subject. The availability of particular formal records depends on the document concerned, so I would not describe an informal summary as a complete record. If something you expect to find is missing, tell me what sort of document you are looking for rather than sending private details in an ordinary email.</speak>